%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: MagicBook_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5fb4d045cc352340a0b295aafdb7db4, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1000000
    m_Localized: "Summons a swarm of water slimes that attack the nearest ground target from a distance and cannot hit flying units. Their trail leaves water fields that make any non-water unit wet, your own included."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000001
    m_Localized: "Fires a hellfire projectile in the target direction that explodes on the first enemy unit, building or base it touches, damaging enemies around the impact and setting the one it hit on fire. Flying units are out of its reach."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000002
    m_Localized: "Erupts a geyser at the target point after a short delay that damages every unit and building in the area, your own included, and launches ground units into the air, heavier ones less. Units thrown up cannot be targeted by ground attackers until they land."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000003
    m_Localized: "Builds a human arcane cannon that shells the closest ground enemy in range, buildings and the enemy base included. It cannot hit flying units, and it leaves rubble that blocks ground movement when destroyed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000004
    m_Localized: "Builds a human anti-air tower that shoots the closest flying enemy in range and also damages enemies right next to it. It cannot attack ground units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000005
    m_Localized: "Opens a well that speeds up your mana regeneration for as long as it stands. Enemies can destroy it, and it dries up on its own after a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000006
    m_Localized: "Summons a water slime archer that walks toward the nearest enemy and shoots it from range. It can hit ground units, flying units, buildings and the enemy base."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000007
    m_Localized: "Summons a mossy rock golem that walks to the nearest ground enemy and punches it, pushing it back a little. It cannot hit flying units, and it leaves rubble that blocks ground movement when it falls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000008
    m_Localized: "Summons a fast wind spirit rider that runs straight for the enemy base and attacks it in melee. It only fights other ground enemies when the base cannot be targeted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000009
    m_Localized: "Summons a flying lightning spirit that shoots ground enemies, buildings and the enemy base from range. It cannot attack other flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000010
    m_Localized: "Summons lesser demons that walk to the nearest ground enemy and spray flames in a line, burning whatever they hit. Their fiery aura also burns every nearby unit that is not fire, your own included."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000011
    m_Localized: "Calls down lightning on a narrow column at the target point at once and twice more after short pauses, hitting every enemy in the column on the ground or in the air. Your own lightning units in the column are charged instead, and each strike leaves a brief electric field that stuns non-lightning units that enter it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000012
    m_Localized: "Summons a heavy magma demon that, on reaching a ground enemy, slams a burst of fire onto its position that damages and burns every enemy around it. It cannot target flying units, its aura burns every nearby unit that is not fire, and it leaves rubble when it falls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000013
    m_Localized: "Places a healing totem that heals your own units, buildings and base within its reach at regular intervals, flying units included. If it is placed on top of a friendly unit it follows that unit, and it fades after a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000014
    m_Localized: "Whips up a dust storm at the target point that lingers and keeps damaging every enemy standing inside it. It only reaches ground enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000015
    m_Localized: "Sends a tornado drifting slowly from the target point toward the center of the field. It catches ground enemies it touches, spins and lifts them into the air, and damages them more the more it carries."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000016
    m_Localized: "Rains meteors at random spots around the target point for several seconds. Each meteor falls from the sky and hits only the first enemy it touches, on the ground or in the air, and a meteor that touches nothing is wasted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000017
    m_Localized: "Summons a flying cloud dragon that shoots the nearest enemy, ground or air, from range, and wets every unit around it, which puts out burning. Now and then it looses a chain lightning that stuns the first enemy it hits and jumps on to others for less damage each time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000018
    m_Localized: "Summons a flock of fragile thunderbirds that dive onto ground enemies, buildings or the enemy base, hitting harder the farther they fall, then climb back up. They cannot attack flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000019
    m_Localized: "Summons a slow, sturdy tree golem that melee-attacks ground enemies and slowly heals itself. It leaves a trail of leaves that heals anyone standing on it, friend or foe, and slows units that are not nature."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000020
    m_Localized: "Summons vine spirits that shoot the nearest enemy, ground or air, from range. Each hit snares the target, slowing it and pulling flying units down, and fire damage tears the snare off for extra damage. Nature enemies are immune."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000021
    m_Localized: "Plants a vine colony that raises a vine under the nearest ground enemy in reach every few seconds, damaging and slowing everything the vine touches. The colony can be attacked and fades after a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000022
    m_Localized: "Summons a rune-stone shaman of the rock golem tribe that walks toward the nearest enemy and throws two rocks per attack, one at each of the two closest enemies in range, or both at one if it is alone. It hits ground and flying targets alike."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000023
    m_Localized: "Summons a swarm of small seed spirits fallen from the World Tree."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000024
    m_Localized: "Summons a swarm of small ember demons that walk to the nearest ground target and hit it in melee, but cannot attack flying units. Their trail leaves burning fields that scorch any non-fire unit that steps in, your own included."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000025
    m_Localized: "Summons small rock golems that slowly walk to the nearest ground target and hit it in melee. They are sturdy but cannot attack flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000026
    m_Localized: "Summons a flying wind spirit that waits until an enemy flying unit appears, then dives at the nearest one and explodes, damaging flying enemies around it. It also explodes where it is killed and never attacks ground units or buildings."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000027
    m_Localized: "Opens a magma rift at the target point that erupts after a short delay, damaging every unit and building in the area, your own included, and setting enemies on fire. Flying units are out of reach."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000028
    m_Localized: "Places a wind totem that repeatedly pushes enemy ground units in the area in front of it back toward their own base without damaging them, heavy ones less. It fades after a short time and enemies can destroy it sooner; flying units are not pushed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000029
    m_Localized: "Builds a small stationary turret that hurls rocks at the nearest enemy ground unit, building or base within its reach, and it cannot hit flying units. It crumbles after a short time, and enemies can destroy it sooner."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000030
    m_Localized: "Plants a World Tree sapling that heals your ground units, buildings and base standing close to it at regular intervals. It withers after a while, and enemies can destroy it sooner."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000031
    m_Localized: "Launches a wind blade that cuts straight through every enemy ground unit, building and base in its path, dealing less damage to each one it passes, until it leaves the field. It cannot hit flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000032
    m_Localized: "Erupts a line of vines from the caster toward the target one after another, damaging each enemy ground unit, building or base along the line once and snaring it to slow it down. Units do not block the line, flying units are out of reach, and fire damage on a snared target breaks the snare for extra damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000033
    m_Localized: "Calls a water tide that rolls through the field, pushing every enemy ground unit it touches in its direction of travel and dealing only slight damage once to each. It leaves water fields along its path that make any non-water unit wet, your own included, and fades after a short time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000034
    m_Localized: "Rolls a heavy boulder along the ground that damages every enemy it touches and bounces off enemies and the field walls. It disappears after a few bounces and cannot hit flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000035
    m_Localized: "Fires a lightning bolt that strikes the first enemy it touches and briefly stuns it, then jumps to another nearby enemy it has not hit yet, dealing less damage with each jump up to a limited number of enemies. Only the first strike is blocked by what is in its path; later jumps can reach nearby flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000036
    m_Localized: "Summons a cloud that rains over the battlefield."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000037
    m_Localized: "Fires a will-o'-wisp along the ground that takes control of the first enemy unit it touches, which then fights for you for good. Bases and some buildings cannot be taken over, and the wisp flies on past them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000038
    m_Localized: "Drops a totem that lands at the target point and throws units around it into a frenzy for a short time: they attack the nearest unit of either side, allies included, and attack faster. It affects your units as well as the enemy's."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000039
    m_Localized: "Drops a leaf fairy that heals the first allied unit, building or base it touches and restarts the lifetime of allied buildings that expire. If it touches an enemy first, it damages and snares that enemy instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000040
    m_Localized: "Drops a boulder from the sky that takes a moment to fall, then damages only the first enemy it touches, ground or flying. It deals no area damage and does nothing if no enemy is under it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000041
    m_Localized: "Deploys a paratrooper of the human magic civilization on the target point who cannot act until it lands, then walks to the nearest ground enemy and fights it in melee. It cannot attack flying units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000042
    m_Localized: "Bursts roots out of the target point after a short delay, damaging and slowing enemies in the area. Your seed spirits in the area grow into tree golems; if there are none, it summons new seed spirits there instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000043
    m_Localized: "Leaves an ember crater that can be attacked and spits fireballs in random directions. A fireball damages the first enemy it touches, otherwise it lands and leaves a fire patch that burns anything standing on it, your own units too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000044
    m_Localized: "Summons a few lightning spirit mice that run past enemy units to the nearest enemy building and attack it in melee, then go for the enemy base. They never target enemy units."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000045
    m_Localized: "Drops a beacon on the target point that stands for a while and cannot be attacked. Allies within a wide reach stop advancing and gather around it, fighting only enemies that come near, and they attack faster while close to it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000046
    m_Localized: "Detonates a lightning charge on the target point after a short delay, shocking enemies in the area so they cannot act. It damages every ground unit, building and base in the area, your own included."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000047
    m_Localized: "Spins up a razor gale on the target point that lasts a few seconds and cuts everything in the area again and again, your own units and buildings included."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000048
    m_Localized: "Builds a bubble generator that wraps the nearest ally in reach in a bubble that blocks the next hit it takes. It skips allies that already have a bubble, never attacks, and fades after a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000049
    m_Localized: "Builds a tower that zaps the nearest enemy in reach, ground or flying, then arcs to a few more nearby enemies for less damage. The tower can be attacked and fades after a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864653363056640
    m_Localized: "Summons a toad that never attacks. It walks toward the nearest enemy building or base and keeps its distance, runs from enemy ground units that come close, and releases fire and lightning tadpoles in turn, starting at once. Tadpoles are short-lived melee ground fighters."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864718152470528
    m_Localized: "Summons a flying Hellfire Legion commander that never attacks itself: it drifts toward the nearest enemy and stops at a distance. Every few seconds it sends out a flying lesser demon that shoots ground and flying targets, up to a limited number in total."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864733830778880
    m_Localized: "Summons a flying water slime that only targets flying enemies. It floats toward the nearest one and shoots bursting bubbles that also hurt other flyers next to the target. It never attacks ground units, buildings or the base."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864741510549504
    m_Localized: "Overloads a lightning charge on the target point: after a short delay it damages and shocks every enemy in the area, then a moment later each shocked enemy bursts, hurting the enemies around it for less damage. Your own units are not hurt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507520
    m_Localized: "Summons a slow MiniRock with an anti-air tower strapped to its back. It walks toward the nearest enemy but always prefers a flyer in reach, shooting it from range with a small splash; against ground enemies it only hits at close range."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507521
    m_Localized: Sort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507522
