  - m_Id: 1864750230507527
    m_Localized: Card Count
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507528
    m_Localized: Summons a slow ground giant that punches enemies from range. When
      a light enemy comes within reach, it drags that enemy in, stuns it, and burns
      it with a fire fist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507529
    m_Localized: Summons a thunder stag that builds up speed and rams ground enemies,
      hitting harder the faster it is going. It bolts away after each hit and zaps
      nearby enemies with small lightning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507530
    m_Localized: Builds a titan remnant that stays for a while and, whenever an enemy
      is in range, thrusts a giant stone fist up under it, damaging enemies around
      that spot. It leaves a rock remnant if destroyed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507531
    m_Localized: Search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507532
    m_Localized: Mana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000050
    m_Localized: Summons a very sturdy, slow rock golem that attacks only ground
      enemies and knocks them back. It leaves a rock remnant behind when it is killed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000051
    m_Localized: Places a trap that arms when an enemy walks into its area, then
      after a short delay stuns every enemy still in the area. It is used up once
      it goes off and deals no damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000052
    m_Localized: Builds a totem that pauses the countdown of nearby allied buildings
      so they last longer while they stay in range. It does not heal them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000053
    m_Localized: Builds a tower that keeps lobbing fireworks onto a fixed spot ahead
      of it toward the enemy side, exploding on arrival and hurting enemies there.
      It does not aim and expires after a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000054
    m_Localized: Builds a structure that keeps growing leaf fields around it, which
      snare enemies and heal allies. Allied seed spirits near it sprout vines that
      hurt nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000055
    m_Localized: Builds a tower that keeps firing burning flame shots straight toward
      the enemy side, hitting the first ground enemy in the line and burning it.
      It does not aim, and it expires after a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000056
    m_Localized: Summons a slow ground serpent that leaves water fields along its
      path. It fires a water beam that hits every enemy standing in a line, flying
      ones included.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000057
    m_Localized: Drains your own units down to half health and channels the stolen
      health into a beam that strikes the closest enemy in the line, four times.
      Damage left over from a kill moves on to the next enemy in the line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000058
    m_Localized: Launches a homing warhead that locks onto the enemy nearest the
      aimed spot, preferring air targets and using ground targets only if none are
      flying. It explodes on the first enemy it touches, hurting enemies around the
      blast, and hits harder against air targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000059
    m_Localized: Hurls a boulder that hits the first enemy in its path, knocking
      it back and stunning it briefly. If the pushed enemy slams into a wall, a rock
      remnant, or another enemy, it takes extra damage, and so does that enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000060
    m_Localized: Summons a flying sprite that flies over ground enemies and drops
      bombs on them, which explode where they land and hurt nearby ground enemies.
      It ignores air targets and does not die when attacking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000061
    m_Localized: Plants a giant vine that damages and slows enemies around it at
      once, then a moment later grows two rings of vines that hit each enemy once
      more. Each enemy the vines hit leaves you a seed spirit, and your seed spirits
      touched by the vines grow into vine spirits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000062
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that spawns a ground seed spirit at regular intervals
      until the nest expires or is destroyed. Seed spirits fight in melee and leave
      leaf fields behind as they walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000063
    m_Localized: Back to list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000064
    m_Localized: All Types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000065
    m_Localized: Unit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000066
    m_Localized: Building
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000067
    m_Localized: Drop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000068
    m_Localized: Explosion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000069
    m_Localized: Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000070
    m_Localized: All Mana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000071
    m_Localized: "Shakes the ground at the chosen spot and raises every rock remnant
      there, from either side, into your own units: small remnants into mini rocks
      and medium remnants into rock golems. It does nothing without remnants."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000072
    m_Localized: Detonates every rock remnant in the area, from either side, after
      a short delay, with each explosion hurting everything near it, your own units
      too. Medium remnants leave a small remnant behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000073
    m_Localized: Defender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000074
    m_Localized: Attacker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000075
    m_Localized: Summons a ground unit that shoots beans in a straight line at the
      closest ground enemy. A bean hits the first ground enemy in its path and cannot
      hit air units.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000076
    m_Localized: Summons a human infantry soldier who strikes ground
      enemies with a short club of condensed magical energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000077
    m_Localized: Summons a Fire and Rock artillery demon. It plants
      its stone mortar before firing explosive shells at ground enemies. Shells land
      at the position aimed at when fired. Packing the mortar takes time before it
      can move again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507533
    m_Localized: Summons a swarm of fire slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507534
    m_Localized: Summons ranged slimes that attack ground enemies and leave wet trails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507535
    m_Localized: Summons a swarm of lightning slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507536
    m_Localized: Summons nature slimes that fight ground enemies and leave leaf fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507537
    m_Localized: Summons a swarm of rock slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507538
    m_Localized: Summons wind slimes that fight ground enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507539
    m_Localized: Fires a shot that explodes on a ground enemy and sets it on fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507540
    m_Localized: Fires a water shot that damages and wets the first enemy it hits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507541
    m_Localized: Fires a lightning shot at enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507542
    m_Localized: Fires a nature shot at enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507543
    m_Localized: Fires a rock shot at enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507544
    m_Localized: Fires a wind shot at enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507545
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning fire slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507546
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning water slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507547
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning lightning slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507548
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning nature slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507549
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning rock slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507550
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning wind slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507551
    m_Localized: Builds a nest that keeps spawning nature slimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507552
    m_Localized: Creates a fire explosion at the chosen spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507553
    m_Localized: Erupts a geyser that damages nearby targets and launches ground
      units. Also hurts allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507554
    m_Localized: Creates a lightning blast that stuns enemies. The blast also hurts
      allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507555
    m_Localized: Creates a nature explosion at the chosen spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864750230507556
    m_Localized: Creates a rock explosion at the chosen spot.
    m_Metadata:
